From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Pawe=C5=82=20Phan?= <szop.hektar_1w@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] instance: report how often an instance was started again
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

procd starts an instance with "respawn" again when it ends, and gives up
after too many crashes in a row; "service list" shows the respawn
values, but not how often it happened. A program that keeps dying and
coming back looks the same as one that never died.

The dump of an instance with "respawn" now has "respawns", how often
procd started it again since the instance was set up, and "crashes",
the runs in a row shorter than the threshold, which procd compares with
the retries.

Upstream: not submitted
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Paweł Phan <szop.hektar_1w@icloud.com>
Signed-off-by: Paweł Phan <szop.hektar_1w@icloud.com>
---
 service/instance.c | 4 ++++
 service/instance.h | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/service/instance.c b/service/instance.c
index 1ceec9a..7e8c7c3 100644
--- a/service/instance.c
+++ b/service/instance.c
@@ -1158,6 +1158,7 @@ instance_exit_done(struct service_instance *in)
 			service_event_instance_exit("instance.fail", in);
 		} else {
 			service_event_instance_exit("instance.respawn", in);
+			in->respawns++;
 			uloop_timeout_set(&in->timeout, in->respawn_timeout * 1000);
 		}
 	}
@@ -2256,6 +2257,9 @@ void instance_dump(struct blob_buf *b, struct service_instance *in, int verbose)
 		blobmsg_add_u32(b, "timeout", in->respawn_timeout);
 		blobmsg_add_u32(b, "retry", in->respawn_retry);
 		blobmsg_close_table(b, r);
+		/* How often it ended, and how often it ended too soon in a row. */
+		blobmsg_add_u32(b, "respawns", in->respawns);
+		blobmsg_add_u32(b, "crashes", in->respawn_count);
 	}
 
 	if (in->trace)
diff --git a/service/instance.h b/service/instance.h
index b04ce01..1fe7018 100644
--- a/service/instance.h
+++ b/service/instance.h
@@ -84,6 +84,8 @@ struct service_instance {
 	bool restart;
 	bool respawn;
 	int respawn_count;
+	/* How often the instance was started again since it was set up. */
+	uint32_t respawns;
 	int reload_signal;
 	struct timespec start;
 	struct timespec stop;
